248
00:09:08,076 --> 00:09:09,062
objective one,

249
00:09:09,062 --> 00:09:10,329
setting up Python,

250
00:09:10,329 --> 00:09:11,807
virtual environments,

251
00:09:11,807 --> 00:09:12,723
dependencies,

252
00:09:12,723 --> 00:09:14,271
and project structure.

